	(gr_text "250:1 planar transformer for 2.5V & 10A output.\n1200V --> 2.1V 10A, 250KHz, 30% duty\nNp/Ns = (Vin * D) / (Vout * (1 - D)) = 245\nNp = 245 turns, Ns = 1 turn\n\nL = ((u0 * N^2 * A) / l)\nWhere...\nu0 = 4 * pi * 10^(-7)\nN = 250 (25 turns x 10 layers)\nA = 0.0325m x 0.01225m\nl = 0.0016m\nThus, L = 19.543mH"
		(at 15 100 0)
